  // Loot table schema per loot-table-spec §4. Every item_id below must resolve
  // against data/items/items.json — LootTableRegistryLoader fails the load
  // otherwise, because a table that grants nothing is invisible in play.
  //
  // These three tables exist to exercise the schema end to end (guaranteed
  // drops, weighted entries, all four rarity tiers, count ranges, and each
  // condition), not to be balanced content. Real drop tables — hide, meat,
  // bones, weapons — arrive with the item pass in Phase 5; only block items
  // exist to point at today. Rolling, Legendary name generation and first-kill
  // tracking are Phase 5 too: this file is shape only.
  {
